msgid "Lists the generated runtime files in the data folder with size, modification time and, optionally, SHA-256 hashes, plus missing and unexpected files and the runtime settings file state. ok means the file exists and is readable; no hash comparison is performed. missing lists only files this install should have produced: the Early Init router and the auto-trust file are left out while the layer or the feature is off. extra lists other files present in the folder, which may belong to add-ons. File contents are never returned."
